chancellor, amazon, ferz, wazir, grasshopper, nightrider (chess.com KnightRider), camel _w/_b.png = chess.com's exact variant
piece art, the art the iwantcheckmate videos show (chess.com variants client): https://www.chess.com/r2/client-packages/variants/2026.11.4/variants.js
entries 111-146 (current theme), regex r"\[Ye\.(\w+)\]:'((?:\\'|[^'])*)'"; body wrapped in <svg viewBox="0 0 180 180">,
